01:00:56.210 --> 01:01:04.130
<v Ira Glass>Sure, you always love Shakespeare, the Beatles, the BBC, Harry Potter. But it was Fleabag that put him over the top.

01:01:04.130 --> 01:01:09.830
<v Hamza Syed>So, from that point onwards, I've started calling myself British. I was just like, well, I'm British. I own this country.

01:01:09.830 --> 01:01:14.440
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life.

